The OTHER_SENSORS permission, duress PIN/password, automatic BFU reboot, and
per-connection Wi-Fi privacy implementations are adapted from GrapheneOS
Android 16 QPR2 platform sources under Apache-2.0-compatible licensing. Exact
upstream commits and lenOS adaptation notes are recorded in each patch.

The PIN scrambling implementation itself is already part of LineageOS; lenOS
only changes its unset default. LineageOS's existing POLICY_REJECT_ALL firewall
is used unchanged.
